map_features.text:
OPEN PERIMETER W / N: no fence identified;
scrub + conifers, dirt track loops round
the sport court (unobserved approach).

DRIVE: grey asphalt, colour uniform;
cracking / patching not judgeable at
~0.26 m/px. Edges soft (canopy).

SPORT COURT N: teal hard surface, uniform;
lines / net not discernible; dark edge band
(fence / windscreen?) verify.

LAWNS N + E: uniformly green, edges even;
no brown or dry patches seen. Heads /
overspray / pooling: not visible.

Dirt track loops W + N of the court;
open native ground on all sides (uneven,
scrub + conifers; fuel: see F).
